---
description: |
  Detects the SOC Prime High-Order Sigma rule "From a Deceptive Purchase Order
  to Remcos RAT".

  From a Deceptive Purchase Order to Remcos RAT

  The rule chains 6 stages of SOC Prime behavior rules by host. See
  `socprime::hos::chain` for the correlation and the resulting Detection
  Finding.
args:
  named:
    - name: timeframe
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: The time span that a chain must fit into.
    - name: threshold
      type: float
      default: 0.6
      description: The share of stages a host must cover, between 0 and 1.
    - name: tolerance
      type: duration
      default: 1min
      description: How far findings of a host may arrive out of time order.
---

